# Bundled tokenizer assets (Exact Tokenizer plan, Phase 1) are verified
# byte-for-byte against a SHA-256 manifest at load time
# (ragmonk.tokenization.model_tokenizer). They MUST be checked out
# exactly as committed on every platform -- git's autocrlf line-ending
# conversion on Windows would rewrite the JSON/text files with CRLF,
# changing their bytes and failing the integrity check. Marking them
# binary disables any end-of-line normalization or diffing.
src/ragmonk/tokenization/assets/** binary
